SUMMARY:Downtown FWB Saturday Market
DESCRIPTION:Local vendors set up along the waterfront at Fort Walton Beach
  Landing Park for a Saturday morning market of handmade goods\, produce\,
  and food. The Downtown FWB group runs it rain or shine on the second and
  fourth Saturday of every month\, so this window covers both October 10 a
 nd October 24. Admission is free and the market sits right on the water\,
  so it makes an easy stop before or after a walk at the park. The vendor 
 lineup changes week to week\, and organizers post updates on their Facebo
 ok page.\nPrice: Free\nArea: Destin & Fort Walton\nTimes: Saturday 10/10 
